  "core_design_rules": [
    "Ninja is a full 1-12 extended class and uses 1/5/9 as its primary scaling milestones where applicable.",
    "Throwing Mastery, Shadow Arts, and Ninpou Training are stances that enhance branches rather than hard-locking access to them.",
    "The first stance change each turn is free and exists to encourage adaptation rather than punish flexibility.",
    "Huuma Shuriken is a small-area thrown attack, not a pure single-target strike.",
    "Soul is the central buff of the class and should meaningfully support Throwing, Shadow Arts, Ninpou, and Final Strike.",
    "Final Strike is intentionally high-commitment and should feel dangerous to use."
  ]
